Lay a pressure triggered bear trap that snaps onto the first creature passing over it.  Victims are dealt [83, 95, 105, 113, 120 (TRAP MASTERY TL1-5; CUN 100)] physical damage and become snared (pinned and slowed 30%) and wounded for [83, 95, 105, 113, 120 (TRAP MASTERY TL1-5; CUN 100)] bleeding damage over 5 turns.  Creatures that avoid being snared still suffer bleeding damage.
